# Check every text file out with LF on every platform. GitHub's Windows
# runners set core.autocrlf=true, which rewrites text files to CRLF at
# checkout; three test files hash or byte-compare files in this tree
# (tests/test_fleet_conventions.py's sha256 pin of tests/fleet_conventions.json,
# tests/test_vendor_pins.py, tests/test_seed_dirs_in_step.py), and a CRLF
# checkout would make the pinned bytes differ from the committed ones on
# Windows alone. The index carries no CRLF files, so this changes nothing on
# Linux and macOS.
* text=auto eol=lf
